sequenceDiagram
  actor User as 用户
  participant Web as Web
  participant API as API认证与权限
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  User->>Web: 输入账号口令
  Web->>API: POST /auth/login + CSRF/Origin
  API->>DB: 校验账号与口令哈希 保存sid_hash与idle/absolute期限
  DB-->>API: 用户状态与角色/范围
  API-->>Web: HttpOnly Secure SID Cookie + traceId
  Web->>API: GET /me
  API->>DB: 会话状态及当前权限
  API-->>Web: 菜单与权限展示数据
  Note over API,DB: 每个业务请求都重新强制检查权限和数据范围
